                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                Oh no! Looks like there's a break in the chain!                 
                                                                                
     Perles reads this embedded Dolt project through bd, but can't find bd:     
                   bd export failed: bd CLI not found on PATH                   
                                                                                
       Install bd 1.0.5 or later, put it on PATH and start perles again.        
                                                                                
    Or switch the project to Dolt server mode, which perles reads directly.     
                        New project with no issues yet:                         
                                bd init --server                                
                                                                                
         Existing project (bd init --server refuses one that has data):         
     1. in this project:     bd backup init <backup-dir> && bd backup sync      
     2. in a new directory:  bd init --server                                   
     3. in that directory:   bd backup restore --force <backup-dir>             
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                Press q to quit                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                